    "name": "KABUKI FIRE",
    "steam_appid": 3369200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/b2d42e388e085969c464f927ad3a35e2.avif?t=1755126907\" width=1300 height=1020 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/5ebd86bec6b2568671f04ce04c94de9f.avif?t=1755126907\" width=1000 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/2f89215db831ea0d0a34343875cd45b7.avif?t=1755126907\" width=800 height=680 /></span><strong>Welcome to <i>KABUKI FIRE! </i></strong>Every year, during the peak of the rainy season, the world's best shooters gather on an zombie infested island, to participate in a lethal challenge. Armed with a set of pistols, participants are locked inside an abandoned village, to fight hordes of fiercely attacking creatures like Kabuki Dragons and Zombie Mosquitoes. One of the contestants is young yakuza Kamoku Shimazu. Driven by desire to revenge her beloved father's death, she enters the competition to win the trust of the crime lord, who once ordered the assassination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/ef0eaa8ca225a95e2cb53b2090dd3023.avif?t=1755126907\" width=703 height=651 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/f16f7924f849953ccd5698fe1406a039.avif?t=1755126907\" width=625 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes and precision in this quirky hand-painted 2D shoot 'em up. The goal is to score points by shooting enemies and bonus objects within a time frame of 5 minutes. Climb up the high-score table and reach the rank of black belt (or maybe even one of the legendary red belts!). As the time counter progresses, your enemies are getting more aggressive and are furiously throwing dragon fire and zombie slime at you. Although you have unlimited ammo at your disposal, you are required to reload your gun regularly! Some enemies leave bonus objects in the arena after they vanish. These bonuses can be cached and stored in the inventory for strategic use or released immediately as they appear. The arsenal of bonuses include...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chain Bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mighty Hammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ice Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Razor Blades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Plasma Storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Distracting Doll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/91baa563fd97c2e53f236dfe0f041a3e.avif?t=1755126907\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/547e176b95540cfb58c8e734934047ab.avif?t=1755126907\" width=400 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique hand-painted art-style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many bonus objects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>5 minutes playtime per round</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial arts style</strong> <strong>belt grading system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and global leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulty levels to choose from - Cozy, Semi and Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great for testing and training your reflexes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING! KABUKI FIRE CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS THAT MAY POTENTIALLY TRIGGER SEIZURES IN PEOPLE WITH PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY. VIEWER DISCRETION IS ADVISED</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/48ae1a2139ee7ad2d323ee6e25f3675e.avif?t=1755126907\" width=766 height=484 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/7e7cf3ebae75ad06f25704e4b766c2ce.avif?t=1755126907\" width=800 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/9fe27f72cfb43ab879b5187ed85ab1a2.avif?t=1755126907\" width=748 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
