ng>5 minutes playtime per round</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial arts style</strong> <strong>belt grading system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and global leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulty levels to choose from - Cozy, Semi and Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great for testing and training your reflexes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING! KABUKI FIRE CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS THAT MAY POTENTIALLY TRIGGER SEIZURES IN PEOPLE WITH PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY. VIEWER DISCRETION IS ADVISED</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/48ae1a2139ee7ad2d323ee6e25f3675e.avif?t=1755126907\" width=766 height=484 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/7e7cf3ebae75ad06f25704e4b766c2ce.avif?t=1755126907\" width=800 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/9fe27f72cfb43ab879b5187ed85ab1a2.avif?t=1755126907\" width=748 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
